      "size": "m",
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "Clickable prototype: select 1 · Dispatch and press Play (or open it full window), then click through like the real app.\n\nThe core loop: Needs you (activity bar or Dispatch) → Answer · Inspect failures → Retry · Review → Accept → back to Tasks.\nAlso: New task → Delegate, ⌘K search, the planner chip → Budget, Settings from the activity bar, Terminal → the panel, Live dispatch rows → session or trace.\nThe tray (19) links into the same screens."
